          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "-: Not only can you listen to the updates in your forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "You can also update the forum on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 11.4,
          "en": "Just like in the template driven approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 15.69,
          "en": "set value and patch value are there for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.69,
          "end": 17.46,
          "en": "I will quickly show it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.46,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "You can of course, on your forum as a whole,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 23.91,
          "en": "call set value and pass a JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "Which should now resemble the object structure up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 28.14,
          "en": "when you create the forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.14,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "So where you have your user data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 33.683,
          "en": "which then is an object, where you have your username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.683,
          "end": 37.713,
          "en": "and set is equal to Max, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.64,
          "end": 40,
          "en": "Have your email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 45.633,
          "en": "set is equal to max@test.com.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.25,
          "end": 49.083,
          "en": "Have your gender,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.25,
          "end": 51.093,
          "en": "male.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.32,
          "end": 57.32,
          "en": "And of course your hobbies, potentially an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "So, if we do this, we should see that now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "our form is pre-populated with some values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 68.03999999999999,
          "en": "because we immediately call set value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "And of course you can also call this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "up on the click of a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "And as in the template driven approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 77.37,
          "en": "you also have patch value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.37,
          "end": 81.69,
          "en": "Of course, if you only want to update a part of the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.69,
          "end": 85.32,
          "en": "like for example, the username, switch this to Anna.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.32,
          "end": 88.47,
          "en": "Now you should see that the username, is changed to Anna.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.47,
          "end": 92.25,
          "en": "The rest still contains the values I set with set value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "So, just to bring this to your attention.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 96.90299999999999,
          "en": "Patch value and set value are also available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.029,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "And the same is true for resetting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "So, if you want to reset the form after submitting it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 106.59,
          "en": "we can simply call reset here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.59,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "So, let's quickly do this, and hit submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "Now it's gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 115.02000000000001,
          "en": "So, this empties our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 118.2,
          "en": "Now, with that, you should have the tools to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
